OL,3,GNEWSATribute to former UK school pupil
OL,4,Akilled in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former pupil at a Scottish high
OL,7,Fschool has been killed in action on the
OL,8,Ffrontline in Ukraine.
OL,10,FArkadii Petrov and his family moved to
OL,11,FDumfries and Galloway when he was a
OL,12,Fteenager, following Russia's invasion
OL,13,Fin 2022.
OL,15,FHe attended Kirkcudbright Academy
OL,16,Fbefore returning to Ukraine to fight
OL,17,Fand was killed in action in the east of
OL,18,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
