OL,3,GNEWSATribute to former UK school pupil
OL,4,Akilled in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Kormylo, archivist at the
OL,7,FUkrainian Prisoner of War chapel in
OL,8,FLockerbie where Petrov attended
OL,9,Fservices, said the whole community was
OL,10,Fupset by the death of a young man.
